      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KICKER SPLASH (1) goes very well this trip starting 22 times for eight wins and six minors. Below best last time at Grafton (20.77) in a Grade 5, finishing a 10 length sixth. Looks suited and should go close. HOPE I CAN (3) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 0.8 lengths at this track in a handy 16.67 beating Cyclone Skylah. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Sure to be thereabouts. WILGUNYA PRINCE (2) trailed the lead and fought on well to be beaten 6 lengths into second (17.25) at this track in a Grade 4/5 over 300m. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Overdue and is among the main hopes. ORSON ROCKET (7) should bounce back after an unplaced effort here recently.",
